        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average disposal\n\n# Included processes\nThis data set describes the production of cuboard hinges, screws, drawer rails and handels for the kitchen. The tall cupboard requires 4 hinges, whereas the bottom and top section need each 2 hinges per cupboard, total 30 hinges are required (steel, 90 g each). Each hinge needs 2 screws (steel, 0.0009 g each) There are 6 drawers with drawer rails (steel, 1.11 kg per drawer) and each drawer needs 24 screws for its rails. All 20 cupboards and drawers have handles (chromium steel, 60 g each) that need 2 screws each. Transport to the construction site is not included. All metallic components are recycled at the end of life.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
